<title>USA: Eagle BancGroup to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Eagle BancGroup to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Ill. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle BancGroup Inc said Wednesday it may repurchase from time to time up to five percent or 60,000 shares of its 1.2 million outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>Recently, the bank holding company completed the purchase of 65,000 shares under a program announced in January 1997.</p>
<p>At June 30, 1997, Eagle BancGroup had assets of $174.3 million.</p>
<p>Shares of Eagle BancGroup were trading up 1/4 to 16-5/8.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
